{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49877","headline":"木兰花 · 徐昌图","name":"木兰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈檀烟起盘红雾，一箭霜风吹绣户。\n汉宫花面学梅妆，谢女雪诗栽柳絮。\n长垂夹幕孤鸾舞，旋炙银笙双凤语。\n红窗酒病嚼寒冰，冰损相思无梦处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐昌图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}